OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning, rain will clear
OL,6,Fsoutheastwards to leave bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells, though feeling cooler
OL,8,Fthan yesterday in the northwesterly
OL,9,Fbreeze. The odd shower may filter
OL,10,Fthrough the Cheshire Gap during the
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FTonight, showers will fade
OL,14,Fbut, under clear skies and with easing
OL,15,Fwinds, temperatures will drop to the
OL,16,Flow single-figures. There may be a
OL,17,Ftouch of grass frost in sheltered
OL,18,Fareas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
